00:58:01.670 --> 00:58:27.580
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]

00:58:27.580 --> 00:58:33.450
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who somehow thinks that I owe him money.

00:58:33.450 --> 00:58:36.320
<v Henry>You're going to give me my check. You're going to give me my check.

00:58:36.320 --> 00:58:55.790
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .

00:58:55.790 --> 00:59:00.790
